  "Question": "The minute hand of a clock is 8 cm long and rotates for 45 minutes (the minute hand rotates \\(6^\\circ\\) per minute). The tip travels an arc length of \\(k\\pi\\) cm. Find the value of \\(k\\).",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "12",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "The angle of rotation is \\(45\\times 6=270^\\circ\\). The arc length is \\(l=270\\pi\\times 8/180=12\\pi\\), so \\(k=12\\).",
